- the price holds after the volume normalizes, with turnover dropping but market cap sustained;
- the triggering post (1lloak) turns out to be a widely shared viral moment that points to this contract as the canonical one.","continuation_view":"strong_fade","research_confidence":"medium","coverage_notes":"I spent about 2 of the 8 minutes, running one web search and one fetch. The X status (x.com/1lloak/status/2102456960536981543) returned HTTP 402, so I could not read the triggering post or its engagement. I searched for the name and found an older 2025 'blind ape' ⠁⠏⠑ token on Phantom and an unrelated $BLIND site, but nothing about this contract specifically. I did not access Telegram, Discord or GMGN wallet-level detail. The bear case rests mainly on the packet's on-chain metrics (the seller/buyer asymmetry, matched buy and sell counts, and unlocked LP), which are strong regardless of what the social content says.","sources":[{"url":"https://phantom.com/tokens/solana/G6r6PHhUic7nqr1YT8ajiya9LRoju2XxNefEtFWupump","what":"Earlier 'blind ape' (⠁⠏⠑) token from 2025, showing the name/ticker is recycled"},{"url":"https://blindapeonsol.fun/","what":"Separate BLIND APE $BLIND project, more evidence the name is crowded or reused"},{"url":"https://twoblindbrothers.com/pages/braille","what":"Website linked in GMGN project_links: a real clothing brand's braille page, apparently unrelated to the token"},{"url":"https://x.com/1lloak/status/2102456960536981543","what":"X status listed as the token's twitter; fetch failed (HTTP 402)"}]}

structured_output.what_would_refute_bear_case:
The bear case would weaken if:
- the number of unique sellers grows broadly along with buyers, instead of staying at a few dozen;
- the LP is burned or locked;
- a real community or account forms around this particular contract (not the clones), with organic X engagement;
- the price holds after the volume normalizes, with turnover dropping but market cap sustained;
- the triggering post (1lloak) turns out to be a widely shared viral moment that points to this contract as the canonical one.
